# Few-shot YOLO11s baselines, one model per task: <shots> <subset>, one agbench eval yolo-shared run per line.
# Each line trains three models (classification, detection, segmentation) on the k-shot training images of all
# datasets of the task; classes are merged by normalised name. Training images: agbench sample-train.
# Lines run in this order (5 shots first: enough for the main comparison).
# Run one line with: uv run --extra yolo agbench eval yolo-shared --data-dir $DATA --shots <shots> --subset <subset> --size s --out runs/yolo11s-shared
5 0
5 1
5 2
